  "quote": "At DBS Global University, we recognize that success is personal. While some students aspire to build impactful careers, others seek admission to leading universities worldwide or dream of creating ventures of their own. To support these diverse ambitions, every student undergoes a Career Aspiration Survey during the penultimate year.",
  "quoteMore": "Based on their goals, students are guided into one of three dedicated mentorship pathways—Career Placements, Higher Education, or Entrepreneurship. Each pathway is supported by specialized teams, industry mentors, and carefully curated interventions that provide personalized guidance and continuous handholding. Whether the destination is a leading organization, a globally reputed university, or a successful startup, our ecosystem is designed to transform aspirations into outcomes.",
